            "open": false,
            "collapse_icon": "caret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "content": "<p>We do our best to show product colours as accurately as possible. However, colours may look slightly different depending on lighting, screen settings, fabric direction, and the natural texture of the material.</p><p>For fabrics such as corduroy, chenille, or suede-style materials, the colour may also appear lighter or darker depending on the angle of the fabric pile.</p><p>Minor colour variation is normal and is not usually considered a product fault.</p><p>If you are unsure about a colour, we recommend ordering fabric samples where available before placing your sofa order.</p>",
