            "content": "<p>If you have any questions about returns, refunds, damaged items or delivery, feel free to reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:support@ozroomy.com\"><strong>support@ozroomy.com</strong></a> or through our <strong>Contact Us</strong> page.</p><p>Our team is always happy to help and usually responds within <strong>24 hours</strong>.</p>",
